@startuml
' [Process Name] Template
' Description: [Brief description of what this process does]
' Author: [Your Name]
' Date: [Creation Date]
' Version: [Version Number]

!theme plain

title [Your Process Title]

' Use start/stop for activity diagrams
start

' Example process steps
:[Step 1 Description];

' Decision points
if ([Condition]?) then (yes)
  :[Action if true];
else (no)
  :[Action if false];
endif

' Parallel processing
fork
  :[Parallel Action 1];
fork again
  :[Parallel Action 2];
end fork

' Loops
repeat
  :[Repeated Action];
repeat while ([Loop Condition]?)

:[Final Step];
stop

' Notes and documentation
note right
  Add explanatory notes here
  for complex processes
end note

@enduml

' Usage Instructions:
' 1. Replace [placeholders] with your actual content
' 2. Customize the flow based on your process
' 3. Add appropriate decision points and loops
' 4. Include notes for clarity
' 5. Test the diagram before committing
' 
' Common PlantUML Elements:
' - start/stop: Process boundaries
' - :action;: Process steps
' - if/then/else/endif: Decision points
' - fork/fork again/end fork: Parallel processes
' - repeat/repeat while: Loops
' - note: Documentation
' - partition: Group related steps
' - |swimlane|: Different actors/systems